Third-party notice: SoL-Pi

dsh-sol reimplements the mechanisms of SoL-Pi (https://github.com/NVlabs/SoL-Pi)
on DeepSeek Harness extension points. Most of the code is a rewrite, but a few
small parts are taken from SoL-Pi, and are marked in the source with a comment
that says so: the failure-signal pattern (lib/reducer.js, FAILURE_SIGNAL) and
the starting point of the secret pattern (lib/reducer.js, LIKELY_SECRET, since
widened). Those parts are covered by the SoL-Pi license below.

